e2dbb4476b4c73c4f567a6973',NULL,'# 有机茶树菇\n## 针对人群：\n控重减脂 + 肠道不适人群： ①高膳食纤维促肠道蠕动，改善便秘困扰\n\n②增强饱腹感减少过量进食，适配控重需求\n\n③低热量低脂肪，不增加身体代谢负担蛋白摄入不足 + 消化较弱人群： ①优质植物蛋白易吸收，补充日常蛋白摄入缺口\n\n②健脾养胃，缓解食欲不佳、消化负担重问题\n\n③营养密度高（含 B 族维生素 + 矿物质），温和补充营养免疫力偏低 + 精力不济人群: ①茶树菇含多糖，',0,300,0,'7bfa422082212656d2da4dec4b376849c89f6d76fa0b63c4675b55c208a00b45','df89ef03a1aca62933089897f24184a13c04adff85ba8ada8e286eb29e204262',0,'2026-08-31 01:51:18.251'),('da90e8a9e8be48e485df0a1583b32f96',1071,'aec61125b035410f864b18e6d39e1201','fb21887024084eb7a038842d0a9c7ca0',NULL,'# 打造工厂化食用菌产业园区为目标\n## 效益分析\n<table><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>序号</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>盈利模式</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>相关服务或活动</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>1</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>技术盈利</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>产业培训、优质种苗培植推广、有机肥生产、智慧设施推广、科创孵化等</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>2</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>服务盈利</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>乡村农科教培训中心、新型职业化农民培育、会议中心、展览、',0,246,0,'263a6399e3d27ab5f2ef63e6e0dc6d4419f4f83eb7cc85cefb46dd77c932257d','83fa92869013cb9501dea4a25393aaffbdac7cbfb9f9b6d6c0caa4302e7c846d',0,'2026-08-29 21:05:00.593'),('db6f1a7086d24d94bcfa0ccd8dbcee06',1207,'4616880e16f04163870d4a17a17fba74','ca2725405b664859b5fc5530388cb425',NULL,'# 检测报告\n## 声明\n纹路，该防伪纹路不支持复印，即复印件不会带有“BCT”防伪纹路。\n\nThe test report is printed by anti-copying paper whose surface shows \"BCT\" security print with specific anticounterfeiting technique. Security print will disappear after copying. Duplicates are not expected to give \"BCT\" security print under any circumstances.\n\n地址：北京市通州区中关村科技园通州园金桥科技产业基地联东U谷西区108#B栋\n\nAdd: No.l08#B building, West of LianDong U valley, Jinqiao science and technology industrial base,Tongzhou Park, Zhongguancun Technology Park, Tongzhou district, Beijing\n\n电话（Tel):010-56370210\n\n邮政编码(Post Code):101102',3,212,0,'610d01d369411615b4116669ab1f9bcdd00763b446c1f7237df65e4ae88b4c86','4d6c802c11d1d5b8a6d86b29b30cfb1dd2b29ece3296c6a21b9cdfc7c7b1f771',0,'2026-08-30 16:55:32.794'),('dd1610af34d248cfaa294