e retest fee. Overdue is deemed to be without objection.\n\n- 3、不可重复或不能进行复测的实验，不进行复测。\n\nExperiments that cannot be repeated or cannot be tested shall not be carried out again.\n\n- 4、委托单位提供样品时应对样品的代表性和资料的真实性负责。\n\nThe principal is responsible for the representativeness of the samples and the authenticity of the data when providing samples.\n\n- 5、本报告仅对所测样品负责，报告数据仅反映对所测样品的评价，对于报告及所载内容的使用、使用所产生的直接或间接损失及一切法律后果，本单位不承担任何经济和法律责任。\n\nThis report is only responsible for the provided sample.The test results only represent the evaluation of the tested sample. BCT will not be responsible for any economical or legal liability generated from direct or indirect usage of the test report.\n\n- 6、本单位有权在完成报告后处理样品。',1,278,0,'5107df1a3be5921a915474c5fdd36bea5c7f16adadad85062b3202f835b07e99','09f44c67d2f6c56ce988436ef8a1641e8dfc8e9aad5441a8565f856ca87de341',0,'2026-08-30 16:56:59.660'),('fcd666717b74437da7a71a9d3c0d5f35',1005,'842fc51a01e8408d9485c1f839ae2543','c7d6120bb76d43778909253c396d8e54',NULL,'# 一、公司介绍\n## 2、绿色食品\n；\n\n- 6）绿色食品认证评审委员会(认证评审)\n\n（4）绿色产品、有机食品、无公害产品的区别有机食品：不使用农药、激素、化肥等有害物质，国际公认的最安全的食品； 绿色食品：在无污染的生态环境中种植及全过程标准化生产或加工的农产品无公害食品:使用一些农药，但控制在国家规定的允许范围内； 普通食品：不限制使用农药、化肥、生长调节剂、转基因等。\n\n（5）在市场上如何识别绿色食品？\n\n一看绿标：绿色食品图标是上方的太阳、下方的叶片和中心的蓓蕾，字体白字绿底。',2,289,0,'e8c4c574ae05838db174b59001c5ce37c3e41f6fd84561344c2dbc8025793b46','446935b3c9632cfe1266767068cc4687f54eed8a8b0556e7aa772f456406dd64',0,'2026-08-29 21:04:35.314'),('fe02a648cd0947e09abc1f4e3712d266',1277,'bdededbd6a394bb1a53e9048791d78cc','f834bf456a784b52b7464dfec2e88347',NULL,'# 检测报告\n## Beijing Century Kehuan Ecological Agriculture Institute 检测报告(Testing Report)\ntr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>检测项目Test Items</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=5>见附页</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>检测依据Test Standards</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=5>见附页</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>检测结果Test Results</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=5>见附页</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>备注Note</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=5></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=4 colspan=2>上新市浦市局检测检测专章Special Stamp of TestingBCT</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>编制人Edited by</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>彭浩</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>审核人Checked by</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>李碧坤</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>批准人Authorized by</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>',3,300,0,'3ee7da0007917f41d75ac0b08828ce93b32966013dd00a68e1fe3710a6539074','1bb83dcd8358aca4c847115041b1f936dc6b97228158b70140a1f95b38a2a02e',0,'2026-08-30 16:56:54.742'),('fe1090cdb3994e7a831bed200e84c8a4',1377,'4bf76864b7c047ce94a76836d4422fe9','3f0758356dd8473a96f2283c12a56fb2',NULL,'# **三、数据中台（文档入库流水线 + 企业知识库 Wiki）**\n## **3.1 系统定位**\n数据中台由“文档入库流水线”演进为企业知识库 Wiki 产品：流水线负责 PDF / Word / PPT / Markdown / 图片的转换、切片、向量化与入库（Milvus）；Wiki 在其上实现“上传 → 转换 → 草稿 → 编辑 → 发布 → 搜索 → 点回页面”的完整闭环，遵循“内容是源头、向量是派生物”的架构原则。',0,166,0,'9a1298e71b331800e24985fb3d1a3ea7b3af22e24b3cf5d52868e52349e8931b','9a1298e71b331800e24985fb3d1a3ea7b3af22e24b3cf5d52868e52349e8931b',0,'2026-09-30 02:07:04.892'),('feac4497e5a5401aaf5053b3d2699201',1050,'aec61125b035410f864b18e6d39e1201','d7062528a0354fb8a5bf07d2ee889287',NULL,'# 打造工厂化食用菌产业园区为目标\n## 农产品质量安全追溯\n数字农业动能集群化标准化数字化品牌化聚集新兴产业提升产业活力技术数据赋能助力产业升级布局数字经济激发产业新动能信息流资金流物流商流\n\nBASIC 品牌营销产业聚集创新孵化智能供应链数字农业产业园产业集聚空间|创新空间|数字经济展厅数据仓物流仓',0,174,0,'a01bddda12d542af0eeb860b2f6037476e3fce546bc65bd7239794b3c0c0d5b9','a01bddda12d542af0eeb860b2f6037476e3fce546bc65bd7239794b3c0c0d5b9',0,'2026-08-29 21:05:00.593'),('fed5a4b14d1945c7b330b429f6f0e3e8',1237,'bc128858202f4106b1a1a2a57b7290f7','ce3a78ab8872420f9d449ef29ab246e6',NULL,'# 检测报告\n## 声明\n### Statement\n\n- 1、本报告无检测专用章、批准人签字及骑缝章无效。\n\nThis report is invalid without special seals for testing, signatures of approvers and Paging seals.\n\n- 2、委托单位对报告数据如有异议，请于报告完成之日起十五日内向本单位书面提出复测申请，同时附上报告原件并预付复测费。如果复测结果与异议内容相符，本单位将退还委托单位的复测费。逾期视为无异议。\n\nIf the entrusted unit is meaningful to the report data, please submit a written application for retest to the entrusted unit within 15 days from the date of completion of the report, and attach the original report and pay the retest fee in advance. If the retest result accords with the applicant dissent. BCT will refund the retest fee. Overdue is deemed to be without objection.\n\n- 3、不可重复或不能进行复测的实验，不进行复测。',0,268,0,'610d01d369411615b4116669ab1f9bcdd00763b446c1f7237df65e4ae88b4c86','44bf1904298695d56b88a1212a48db260f7bebc605b8eee109b317de4a83b1df',0,'2026-08-30 16:56:44.388'),('fee2ea24b2c7436a9fc4c07ca9097982',982,'842fc51a01e8408d9485c1f839ae2543','6e3c80c4fe85421b8e6806c7b176c411',NULL,'# 一、公司介绍\n## （2）产：标准化生产“新基建”，降本增效保品质\n公司全产业链的“品质中枢”，通过智能化设备替代传统人工操作，实现菌种扩繁、菌棒生产的全程可控、全程追溯，为后续加工与销售提供“稳定、安全、低成本”的原料保障。\n\n- 1）全智能菌种工厂\n\n采用“物联网+AI环境调控”系统，实时监控菌种扩繁环节的温湿度 $\\mathrm { ( \\pm 0 . 5 ^ { \\circ } C }$ 精度）、光照强度、 $\\mathrm { C O } _ { 2 }$ 浓度（自动换气），搭配自动化接种线（减少人为污染），使菌种成活率提升至98%以上（传统人工接种约85%）；',0,283,0,'f387ef5d1b363b437db8e2da1557a015676edcaf69b8d11f705e596b5f6968ca','b5c8fbff025b1f72c6a8f0aa999f1ca6ab7f15a3d360d92938ff30adac67dfdd',0,'2026-08-29 21:04:35.314'),('ff4b89b3dfd2418eb4c176fea32cb042',1216,'4616880e16f04163870d4a17a17fba74','d190e7d468324dbab00ab63c7d0b8bba',NULL,'# 检测报告\n## Beijing Century Kehuan Ecological Agriculture Institute 检测报告(Testing Report)\n限：0.0750)</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>mg/kg</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>7</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>多菌灵</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>GB/T 20769-2008</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>未检出(检出限：0.12)</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>μg/kg</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>8</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>咪鲜胺（咪鲜胺和咪鲜胺锰盐)</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>GB 23200.8-2016</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>未检出(定量限：0.0750)</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>mg/kg</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>9</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>腐霉利</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>GB 23200.8-',3,300,0,'7a2019770140b45ede7e09c2216dd79d5556fb91eecff39c2cb902e545fd3f36','24c3ff0bd3d589ed52d7368f54b9303bcb7a3e27685424a8e4380919f1b16029',0,'2026-08-30 16:55:32.794'),('ff5d6522a6c7419b815c11772bb1bda6',1325,'bdb352087824476aa343a07aa61018a8','30df4e9d85dc4d5495bc2ec3d3c9efbb',NULL,'# 有机鸡枞菌礼盒\n## 核心优势：\n织修复与生理机能需求，无多脂肪摄入，是健身减脂群体的不二之选。【高性价比】一级产品精挑细选，是有机认证产品，从源头菌种到采摘加工全流程把握品质，等价格下优于市场其他产品品质。',2,126,0,'ea33ec27d8227a28c824ed7f90d178eec99206024dbea60276c84df7d71f9aad','979606f0a338ec0c8b88d978812247c5a513751d3c08eb14f277e200a0d86389',0,'2026-08-31 01:51:08.826');
