y or falsification of the content is unlawful. BCT will investigate above acts for their legal liability.\n\n△防伪说明(Anti-counterfeiting Description)\n\n(1) 报告编号都是唯一的\n\nThe test report has exclusive report code.\n\n(2)报告采用防伪纸张印刷，表面带有“BCT”防伪纹路，该防伪纹路不支持复印，即复印件不会带有“BCT”防伪纹路。\n\nThe test report is printed by anti-copying paper whose surface shows \"BCT\" security print with specific anticounterfeiting technique. Security print will disappear after copying. Duplicates are not expected to give \"BCT\" security print under any circumstances.\n\n地址：北京市通州区中关村科技园通州园金桥科技产业基地联东U谷西区108#B栋\n\nAdd: No.108#B building, West of LianDong U valley, Jinqiao science and technology industrial base,Tongzhou Park, Zhongguancun Technology Park, Tongzhou district, Beijing\n\n电话（Tel）:010-56370210\n\n邮政编码(Post Code)：101102\n\n# Beijing Century Kehuan Ecological Agriculture Institute 检测报告(Testing Report)\n\n编号(Report ID):W20252672S002\n\n<table><tr><td rowspan=2 colspan=1>样品名称Sample Name</td><td rowspan=2 colspan=2>菇类【茶树菇（干品）】</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>型号规格Specification</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>商标Trade Mark</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>委托单位名称Client</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>世纪科环检验认证（北京）有限公司</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>联系人Contact Person</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>郑志超</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>单位地址Add</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>北京市通州区中关村科技园区通州园金桥科技产业基地景盛南四街17号7号楼101</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>联系电话Tel</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>生产单位Process Company</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>有机地标(枞阳)生态农业有限公司</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>检测类别Test type</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>委托检测</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>样品量Sample Quantity</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>0.4kg</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>样品状态Sample Status</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>固态、褐色、无腐烂</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>生产日期Processing Date</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2></td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>批号Lot Number</td><t