Report编号(Report ID)：W20252672S003\n\n样品名称 菇类【鹿茸菇（干品）】Sample Name\n\n委托单位 世纪科环检验认证（北京）有限公司Client\n\n检测类别 委托检测 Test Type\n\n北京世纪科环生态农业研究院\n\n![](/media/images/79105f4a584e5bbaa0985ba86eeba29e40b614d21e5f6aeebe8e30fec8db784a.jpg)\n\nBeijing Century Kehuan EcologicalAgriculture Institute\n\n![](/media/images/5891374b88ad885d1756167a9e2eee924ee2cf16b414deafd1f5085aa8b8f822.jpg)\n\n# 声 明\n\n## Statement\n\n1、本报告无检测专用章、批准人签字及骑缝章无效。\n\nThis report is invalid without special seals for testing, signatures of approvers and Paging seals.\n\n2、委托单位对报告数据如有异议，请于报告完成之日起十五日内向本单位书面提出复测申请，同时附上报告原件并预付复测费。如果复测结果与异议内容相符，本单位将退还委托单位的复测费。逾期视为无异议。\n\nIf the entrusted unit is meaningful to the report data, please submit a written application for retest to the entrusted unit within 15 days from the date of completion of the report, and attach the original report and pay the retest fee in advance. If the retest result accords with the applicant dissent. BCT will refund the retest fee. Overdue is deemed to be without objection.\n\n3、不可重复或不能进行复测的实验，不进行复测。\n\nExperiments that cannot be repeated or cannot be tested shall not be carried out again.\n\n4、委托单位提供样品时应对样品的代表性和资料的真实性负责。\n\nThe principal is responsible for the representativeness of the samples and the authenticity of the data when providing samples.\n\n5、本报告仅对所测样品负责，报告数据仅反映对所测样品的评价，对于报告及所载内容的使用、使用所产生的直接或间接损失及一切法律后果，本单位不承担任何经济和法律责任。\n\nThis report is only responsible for the provided sample.The test results only represent the evaluation of the tested sample. BCT will not be responsible for any economical or legal liability generated from direct or indirect usage of the test report.\n\n6、本单位有权在完成报告后处理样品。\n\nBCT has the right to dispose the tested sample after approval of the test report.\n\n7、本报告全部复制或部分复制，私自转让，盗用，冒用、涂改或以其他任何形式篡改均属无效，本单位对上述行为严纠其相应的法律责任。\n\nAny unauthorized reproduce in full or part, piracy, alteration, forgery or falsification of the content is unlawful. BCT will investigate above acts for their legal liability.\n\n△防伪说明(Anti-counterfeiting Description)\n\n（1）报告编号都是唯一的\n\nThe test report has exclusive report code.\n\n(2)报告采用防伪纸张印刷，表面带有“BCT”防伪纹路，该防伪纹路不支持复印，即复印件不会带有“BCT”防伪纹路。\n\nThe test report is printed by anti-copying paper whose surface shows \"BCT\" security print with specific anticounterfeiting technique. Security print will disappear after copying. Duplicates are not expected to give \"BCT\" security print under any circumstances.\n\n地址：北京市通州区中关村科技园通州园金桥科技产业基地联东U谷西区108#B栋\n\nAdd: No.l08#B building, West of LianDong U valley, Jinqiao science and technology industrial base,Tongzhou Park, Zhongguancun Technology Park, Tongzhou district, Beijing\n\n电话（Tel）:010-56370210\n\n邮政编码(Post Code):101102\n\n# Beijing Century Kehuan Ecological Agriculture Institute 检测报告(Testing Report)\n\n编号(Report ID)：W20252672S003\n\n<table><tr><td rowspan=2 colspan=1>样品名称Sample Name</td><td rowspan=2 colspan=2>菇类【鹿茸菇（干品）】</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>型号规格Specification</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>商标Trade Mark</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>委托单位名称Client</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>世纪科环检验认证（北京）有限公司</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>联系人Contact Person</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>郑志超</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>单位地址Add</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>北京市通州区中关村科技园区通州园金桥科技产业基地景盛南四街17号7号楼101</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>联系电话Tel</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>生产单位Process Company</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>有机地标(枞阳)生态农业有限公司</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>检测类别Test type</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>委托检测</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>样品量Sample Quantity</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>0.4kg</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>样品状态Sample Status</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>固态、褐色、无腐烂</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>生产日期Processing Date</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2></td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>批号Lot Number</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=1></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=1 colspan=1>到样日期Received date</td><td rowspan=1 colspan=2>2025-08-21</td>