,'Influencer','Influencer_knowlege','8799bc3e66724ddf8b1e58fe4b3bddb4','## 日本红颜草莓','## 日本红颜草莓\n','## 日本红颜草莓\n','document','aec61125b035410f864b18e6d39e1201','D:\\my_project\\file pipeline channel\\uploads\\22bd922c227f89a1803240d8582607182c3dc0182deccfd652a4ae2b5aa90a91.pdf','公司','{\"images\": [{\"alt\": \"\", \"ref\": \"/media/images/139e5330a90581d8806d57d553647ee32246dff1b75ae6df38dd5ed7330aae71.jpg\"}], \"product_id\": \"2\"}','active','tenant',1,'3b4e7cbdae0940a59d64802573709b70ad966b2f80b6a8a6dd7cc3bdd17c8094',10,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-29 21:07:04.664','pipeline','pipeline','2026-08-29 21:07:04.723','2026-08-29 21:07:04.723'),(376,'Influencer','Influencer_knowlege','a5c44b444bbf42239d75c14a4a5b24a3','## Let’s Support','## Let’s Support\n\n目前最优秀的日本草莓品种之一，是日本静冈县枥木草莓繁育场以幸香为父本，章姬为母本杂交选育而成的早熟栽培品种。因其植株基部红色，果实鲜红漂亮而得名。','## Let’s Support\n\n目前最优秀的日本草莓品种之一，是日本静冈县枥木草莓繁育场以幸香为父本，章姬为母本杂交选育而成的早熟栽培品种。因其植株基部红色，果实鲜红漂亮而得名。','document','aec61125b035410f864b18e6d39e1201','D:\\my_project\\file pipeline channel\\uploads\\22bd922c227f89a1803240d8582607182c3dc0182deccfd652a4ae2b5aa90a91.pdf','公司','{\"images\": [{\"alt\": \"\", \"ref\": \"/media/images/da09f626e83f4d69e7742ceca5560702edc6ba6e61ccd523049179c54a73ed16.jpg\"}], \"product_id\": \"2\"}','active','tenant',1,'2a04a12a34842ff30766cc119e81c3510f893fe873e04f94e3fac0eed29c71c2',91,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-29 21:07:04.664','pipeline','pipeline','2026-08-29 21:07:04.725','2026-08-29 21:07:04.725'),(377,'Influencer','Influencer_knowlege','08b1786bc54143f7915649754f0a4155','## 彩椒、黄瓜、西红柿','## 彩椒、黄瓜、西红柿\n彩椒富含多种维生素（丰富的维生素C）及微量元素，不仅可改善黑斑及雀斑，还有消暑、补血预防感冒和促进血液循环等功效。','## 彩椒、黄瓜、西红柿\n彩椒富含多种维生素（丰富的维生素C）及微量元素，不仅可改善黑斑及雀斑，还有消暑、补血预防感冒和促进血液循环等功效。','document','aec61125b035410f864b18e6d39e1201','D:\\my_project\\file pipeline channel\\uploads\\22bd922c227f89a1803240d8582607182c3dc0182deccfd652a4ae2b5aa90a91.pdf','公司','{\"product_id\": \"2\"}','active','tenant',1,'5574d32b049aba38e1235b855291e92228c2f1be73f4a446dfc9d118569b0a04',70,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-29 21:07:0